      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "UNSTABLE MABLE (8) turned in a fair 4th placed finish last time at this track over 352m (20.10). Strike rate this course and distance strong having won three of five tries. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Has ability and can bounce back. SURF SIZE QUEEN (1) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by 5.5 lengths at Q Straight in a handy 16.63 beating Let Me Go. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Capable of going well again. ZABDON SKIPPY (2) is going well, finishing in the placings twice in a row. Not beaten far last time when a long neck third (17.01) in a Grade 5 at Q Straight. Rates a winning chance on best. SUMMER'S DUNAY (6) will have admirers after placing last time out.",
